      }
     ],
     "value": "Monomer (By similarity). Homodimer (PubMed:26403541, PubMed:40691517). Interacts with SLC8B1/NCLX; required for SLC8B1/NCLX antiporter activity (PubMed:40200126). Interacts with GJA1 (By similarity). Interacts weakly with DSP (By similarity). Interacts with SCN1B (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
